      "comment" : "Protection badge. ADR-0019 \u00a711.3 renders BLOCKED as \"Traffic stopped \u2014 protected\": I3 made visible, never an error the user caused. NO ANDROID COUNTERPART \u2014 that shell carries only O-18's three values, and \u00a711.9(5) says the badge has exactly three. See the header's parity note.",
